# head/adult/man/nose_long: a long nose: the bridge's shadow from the lash row down to the tip; in profile it reaches
# a pixel further and droops at the tip
# P2b FACES (wave 2). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role nose long
layer face
anchor head
keys rest

view D key rest origin -8 -9
|r
|r
|r

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -14 -9
|tq.
|ssq
|rsq

view L key rest origin 1 -9
|.qt
|qss
|qss

# (P2b FACES) elven fineness: thinner, swept-up brows and a finer nose for elves (when elf replace)
view D key rest origin -8 -10 when elf replace
|r
|r

view R key rest origin -14 -9 when elf replace
|tq
|sq

view L key rest origin 0 -9 when elf replace
|qu
|qs
